# What `vercel` uploads from this folder: ONLY what the web app's build needs. An allowlist, not a
# blocklist: the repository also holds the robots (scripts/), their run logs with data
# (scripts/out/), the service account key (secrets/), Apps Script, docs and memory, and a new folder
# of any of those must not reach Vercel because nobody remembered to list it. The deploy of
# 21/10/2026 uploaded secrets/sa.json and 1 214 run logs before this file existed.
/*
!/src
!/public
!/package.json
!/pnpm-lock.yaml
!/pnpm-workspace.yaml
!/next.config.ts
!/next-env.d.ts
!/tsconfig.json
!/postcss.config.mjs
